          "semantic": 2
        },
        "by": "human",
        "reason": "Same Observation.id UUIDv5 inversion as icp, plus a REGEXP_REPLACE that guesses how the source value was stringified in order to rebuild the hash input. Refused by sql_lint (resource-id-inversion); UTC-pinned reads plus comparator key_attribution make it unnecessary. The 100% exact match was earned through an opaque-id side channel and is withdrawn.",
